{"content":[{"c":["AHIHUD"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Shelomi’s son, a leader of Asher’s tribe. Ahihud was appointed to help Eleazar and Joshua divide the territory of Canaan among the Israelites (",{"href":"?bref=Num.34.17,27","r":"Num.34.17,27","rawR":"Num.34.17,27","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.34.17,27","value":"Num.34.17,27"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 34:17, 27"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. According to some English versions (",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},", ",{"c":["rsv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"), a leader in Benjamin’s tribe whose father, Gera (also called Heglam), was exiled to Manahath (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.7","r":"1Chr.8.7","rawR":"1Chr.8.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.7","value":"1Chr.8.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:7"},"). But according to the Hebrew Masoretic Text, this Ahihud’s father was Ehud (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.6","r":"1Chr.8.6","rawR":"1Chr.8.6","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.6","value":"1Chr.8.6"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:6"},"), while Gera was the one who exiled Ahihud and his mother to Manahath."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Ahihud","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 34:17, 27","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.34.17,27","rawQueryValue":"Num.34.17,27","sourceRefExact":"Num.34.17,27"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.7","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.7","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.7"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:6","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.6","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.6","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.6"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"f8be6c3a825863ad13cddf5ce8f30f04fc68a19ac3348ec921a61093576cb960","sourceItemName":"Ahihud","sourceItemOrder":184,"sourceMember":"Articles/A.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Ahihud","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Ahihud","title":"Ahihud","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}